Particularly in the region,
we have training exchanges,

00:48:30.740 --> 00:48:32.513
intellectual capacity exchanges.

00:48:34.380 --> 00:48:36.223
We have our lawyers, patent lawyers.

00:48:37.261 --> 00:48:42.170
We could be offering trading
in one university in the region

00:48:42.170 --> 00:48:44.430
and sharing that with others.

00:48:44.430 --> 00:48:45.799
That is be the basis for the future.

00:48:45.799 --> 00:48:47.425
So it's really about building
the ecology for that.

00:48:47.425 --> 00:48:50.241
Our customs clear in systems,

00:48:50.241 --> 00:48:52.477
our payment systems and
platforms, we need...

00:48:52.477 --> 00:48:56.530
So there are a lot of work to be done,

00:48:56.530 --> 00:48:59.010
in terms of providing solutions

00:48:59.010 --> 00:49:03.344
and new systems of exchange.

00:49:03.344 --> 00:49:07.060
And that's where the
excitement is because,

00:49:07.060 --> 00:49:10.900
you can generate so many
things that do not occur,

00:49:10.900 --> 00:49:12.670
that just I'm not there.

00:49:12.670 --> 00:49:14.383
And you can develop a new economy.

00:49:15.640 --> 00:49:17.640
So, I look to our young people

00:49:17.640 --> 00:49:21.833
to really take us to the moon on this.

00:49:23.256 --> 00:49:26.250
And we will pay them to help us do that.

00:49:26.250 --> 00:49:28.970
I think those are the
